@910 = ~Void Execution~
@911 = ~Void Execution

Empowers the Voidstalker's next Netherstrike (it lasts up to one turn). The strike deals an additional 10d6 magic damage and stuns the target for 1 round. The target may save vs. death at -2 to avoid the stun. The additional damage is subject to magic resistance and magic damage resistance.~